BAR Droid phone version of BAR's BuildETA (luaui/widgets/gui_build_eta.lua): the time left above units being built worked
out 5 times a game second instead of every game frame (30). Each update asks the engine for the build progress of every
unit under construction in view of the player: in a late 16-player game 0.2 % of the dev phone's main thread
(docs/ENGINE-SIM.md on engine/sim, "BAR's Lua on phones"). Applied by the engine (BarDroidPhoneLuaDir) to BAR's file as
LuaUI loads it; if a block finds no place, BAR's own file runs.

@@@ find
	if gs == lastGameUpdate then
		return
	end
	lastGameUpdate = gs
@@@ with
	if gs >= lastGameUpdate and gs < lastGameUpdate + 0.2 then -- BAR Droid (phone): 5 times a game second, not every frame
		return
	end
	lastGameUpdate = gs
@@@ end
